<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav August retail sales rise 7.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav August retail sales rise 7.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV RETAIL SALES     Aug 96	 July 96	Aug 95</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	   +7.0	   +5.0	    n.a.</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	     +100	   +104	    n.a.</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO AUG)</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	     +103	   +203	    n.a.</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data exclude private sector. Data cover rump Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
